# Every hidden file and directory under docs/, at any depth, is local-only.
#
# A standing rule rather than a list of exceptions, so a local input file or a
# scratch export needs no edit here to stay out of the repository. The live use
# is `showcase/.participants`, the invite list, which is real personal data and
# which root CLAUDE.md keeps out of this repo absolutely. A `.figma/` dump of
# full-resolution frame exports was the second, and is the kind of thing this
# rule exists to catch without anybody having to remember it.
#
# The negation is load-bearing: `.*` matches this file too, and without the
# exception it could never be added in the first place.
.*
!.gitignore
